    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\Delta \\lambda = \\lambda_f - \\lambda_i = \\frac{h}{m_e c}(1 - \\cos \\theta)\"></span> [1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b\"><p><strong>b</strong></p><p>- <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{h}{m_e c} = \\frac{6.63 \\times 10^{-34}}{9.11 \\times 10^{-31} \\times 3.00 \\times 10^{8}} = 2.43 \\times 10^{-12}\\ \\text{m}\"></span><br/>- <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\Delta \\lambda = 2.43 \\times 10^{-12} (1 - \\cos 60^\\circ) = 2.43 \\times 10^{-12} (1 - 0.5) = 1.22 \\times 10^{-12}\\ \\text{m} = 0.00122\\ \\text{nm}\"></span><br/>- Correct substitution [1 mark] and value [1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"c\"><p><strong>c</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda_f = \\lambda_i + \\Delta \\lambda = 0.050 + 0.00122 = 0.05122\\ \\text{nm}\"></span> [1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"d\"><p><strong>d</strong></p><p>The increase in wavelength indicates photons carry momentum and behave like particles in collisions with electrons [1 mark]</p></section>"
